      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Organization pipeline comparison",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Organization pipeline comparison",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ll-pipeline",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 705,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a8a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1051,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1051,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Link Loom\n1. Extension scans bookmarks and backs up Chrome tree\n2. Backend ingests and clears prior generated structure\n3. Enrichment fetches page metadata\n4. OpenAI embeddings cached by URL hash\n5. Recursive k-means builds hierarchy\n6. Extension previews and applies Chrome mutations",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Link Loom\n1. Extension scans bookmarks and backs up Chrome tree\n2. Backend ingests and clears prior generated structure\n3. Enrichment fetches page metadata\n4. OpenAI embeddings cached by URL hash\n5. Recursive k-means builds hierarchy\n6. Extension previews and applies Chrome mutations",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mm-pipeline",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 670,
      "y": 705,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 130,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#064e3b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1052,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1052,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MarkMind\n1. Popup scans bookmarks and existing folder tree\n2. User selects bookmarks to organize\n3. Service worker sends one prompt to selected provider\n4. LLM returns JSON folder plan + assignments\n5. Popup stores session locally for review\n6. Extension creates folders and moves bookmarks",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MarkMind\n1. Popup scans bookmarks and existing folder tree\n2. User selects bookmarks to organize\n3. Service worker sends one prompt to selected provider\n4. LLM returns JSON folder plan + assignments\n5. Popup stores session locally for review\n6. Extension creates folders and moves bookmarks",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
